# Qwen 3.7 — findings by MiniMax M3.1 Flash

- Source: Alibaba Cloud (no exact public model ID verified — `Qwen3.7` is a generation name)
- Date: 2026-10-31 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.7 — the dataset entry is the Qwen3.7 *generation* name. Alibaba publishes three named members of that generation — Qwen3.7-Max (flagship), Qwen3.7-Plus (balanced) and Qwen3.7-Flash (fast, native vision-language) — and has never shipped a bare "Qwen3.7" checkpoint.
- **Short description:** Not a shippable model. The Qwen3.7 generation was announced 2026-05-19 with Qwen3.7-Max; Qwen3.7-Plus followed 2026-05-31 and Qwen3.7-Flash 2026-07-15. Scoring this slug would double-count members that already have their own folders (`qwen-3.7-max`, `qwen-3.7-plus`, `qwen-3.7-flash`).
- **Provider / access:** No route exists for a bare `qwen3.7`. Live catalogues expose only the members: OpenRouter `qwen/qwen3.7-max`, `qwen/qwen3.7-plus`, `qwen/qwen3.7-flash`, `qwen/qwen3.7-plus:batch`; models.dev `alibaba/qwen3.7-max`, `alibaba/qwen3.7-plus`, `alibaba/qwen3.7-flash`, `bailian/qwen3.7-max`, `bailian/qwen3.7-plus`; Alibaba Cloud Model Studio SKUs `qwen3.7-max`, `qwen3.7-plus`, `qwen3.7-flash`, `qwen3.7-text-embedding`; OpenCode Zen lists **no** Qwen3.7 route (its Qwen ids are `qwen3.5-plus`, `qwen3.6-plus`, `qwen3.8-flash`, `qwen3.8-max`).
- **Release / knowledge:** Generation announced 2026-05-19; member dates Max 2026-05-20 (snapshot `qwen3.7-max-2026-05-20`, later `qwen3.7-max-2026-06-08`), Plus 2026-05-31, Flash 2026-07-15. Knowledge cutoff not published for the generation.
- **IDs:** no exact public ID for a bare "Qwen3.7" — the project slug `qwen-3.7` is a generation label, not a vendor ID. Member IDs are listed above.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens for each member (Qwen3.7-Max and Qwen3.7-Plus both 1M on Artificial Analysis; Qwen3.7-Flash 1M) — these are member figures and cannot be attributed to the generation entry.
- **Modalities:** Qwen3.7-Max text in/out; Qwen3.7-Plus text **and image** in with text out; Qwen3.7-Flash native vision-language (text/image/video understanding with text out). Reasoning/thinking mode is on by default for `qwen3.7-plus`.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-31):** member prices only — Qwen3.7-Max $1.475 in / $4.425 out per 1M on OpenRouter (Alibaba Model Studio lists ¥12 / ¥36 per 1M for `qwen3.7-max-2026-06-08`); Qwen3.7-Plus $0.32 / $1.28; Qwen3.7-Flash cheaper again, Batch at 50% off. No "Qwen3.7" list price exists.
- **Architecture:** proprietary and API-only across the whole generation — Qwen3.7 has **no open-weights checkpoint** (the Hugging Face Qwen organisation API returns an empty result list for `Qwen3.7` on 2026-10-31; Qwen moved on to shipping open weights for Qwen3.8-27B instead). Parameter counts for the generation are therefore undisclosed.

